Map and train data

Railway lines are OpenStreetMap data and stay under the Open Database License.
The geographic basemap is OpenFreeMap / OpenMapTiles (© OpenStreetMap
contributors) plus public Mapzen terrain tiles and is not relicensed here.
Live train positions and journey lists are fetched from mapa.zsr.sk at
runtime. They are not part of this license.
